A student planner builder could include features such as:

    Task Management: Students can add, edit, and delete assignments.
    Calendar: Students can view upcoming deadlines, exams, and events.
    Study Schedule: Students can create personalized study schedules.
    Course Management: Students can organize assignments by class.
    Progress Tracking: Students can track completed and outstanding tasks.
    Reminders: Students can receive notifications about upcoming deadlines.
